#. i18n: file: ReniceDlgUi.ui:293
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, radioIONormal)
#: rc.cpp:135 rc.cpp:343
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
